      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a 2022 f150 with a slipping issue. the diagnostic tool is showing these weird irregular pressure spikes in the hydraulic circuit. what are the most likely causes for these kind of pressure fluctuations in the transmission?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
